   "anchor": "<h5 class=\"tsec\" id=\"pd-mx\">",
   "html": "<figure class=\"lcw lcc\" data-mimic-hub=\"voices\"><div class=\"ttl\"><span><b class=\"step\">4</b>Psychosis, mood or personality?</span><small>not to scale</small></div><ol class=\"wrows\"><li class=\"cr\" data-mrow=\"schizophrenia\" data-mrow-v=\"74cf831f2c45\"><div class=\"wh\"><b class=\"nm mask\">Schizophrenia</b><span class=\"win\">6 months or more in all</span></div><div class=\"wb\"><div class=\"rail cstrip\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:0%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:20%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:38%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:62%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:84%\"></i><i class=\"cs pro\" style=\"--a:30%;--b:38%\"></i><i class=\"cs act\" style=\"--a:38%;--b:46%\"></i><i class=\"cs res\" style=\"--a:46%;--b:100%\"></i></div><div class=\"rax\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"a0\" style=\"--x:0%\">Child</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:20%\">Teens</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:38%\">20s</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:62%\">30s</span><span class=\"a1\" style=\"--x:84%\">40s+</span></div><p class=\"wl\">Onset late teens to 20s, often after a prodrome</p><p class=\"wl\">2 or more, at least 1 of delusions, voices or disorganized speech</p><p class=\"wl dec\">Functioning falls and stays below baseline</p></div></li><li class=\"cr\" data-mrow=\"delusional\" data-mrow-v=\"3560c8bcaef4\"><div class=\"wh\"><b class=\"nm mask\">Delusional disorder</b><span class=\"win\">1 month or more</span></div><div class=\"wb\"><div class=\"rail cstrip\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:0%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:20%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:38%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:62%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:84%\"></i><i class=\"cs only\" style=\"--a:80%;--b:100%\"></i></div><div class=\"rax\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"a0\" style=\"--x:0%\">Child</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:20%\">Teens</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:38%\">20s</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:62%\">30s</span><span class=\"a1\" style=\"--x:84%\">40s+</span></div><p class=\"wl\">Often begins around 40</p><p class=\"wl\">One or more delusions; no prominent voices or disorganization</p><p class=\"wl dec\">Works and behaves normally apart from the delusion</p></div></li><li class=\"cr\" data-mrow=\"bipolar-psychotic\" data-mrow-v=\"2282ae67a871\"><div class=\"wh\"><b class=\"nm mask\">Bipolar I disorder with psychotic features</b><span class=\"win\">Mania 1 week or more, or any length if hospitalized</span></div><div class=\"wb\"><div class=\"rail cstrip\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:0%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:20%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:38%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:62%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:84%\"></i><i class=\"cs hi\" style=\"--a:34%;--b:41%\"></i><i class=\"cs hip\" style=\"--a:55%;--b:62%\"></i><i class=\"cs hi\" style=\"--a:76%;--b:83%\"></i></div><div class=\"rax\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"a0\" style=\"--x:0%\">Child</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:20%\">Teens</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:38%\">20s</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:62%\">30s</span><span class=\"a1\" style=\"--x:84%\">40s+</span></div><p class=\"wl\">Discrete manic episodes; depression common</p><p class=\"wl\">Elated or irritable mood, less sleep, pressured speech</p><p class=\"wl dec\">Psychosis only inside a mood episode</p></div></li><li class=\"cr\" data-mrow=\"schizotypal-pd\" data-mrow-v=\"0348e6bdc4d2\"><div class=\"wh\"><b class=\"nm mask\">Schizotypal personality disorder</b><span class=\"win\">Lifelong, from adolescence or early adulthood</span></div><div class=\"wb\"><div class=\"rail cstrip\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:0%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:20%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:38%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:62%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:84%\"></i><i class=\"cs odd\" style=\"--a:24%;--b:100%\"></i></div><div class=\"rax\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"a0\" style=\"--x:0%\">Child</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:20%\">Teens</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:38%\">20s</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:62%\">30s</span><span class=\"a1\" style=\"--x:84%\">40s+</span></div><p class=\"wl\">Odd beliefs, magical thinking, eccentric dress and speech</p><p class=\"wl\">Few close relationships; paranoid ideas common</p><p class=\"wl dec\">Odd perceptions short of frank psychosis, not persistent</p></div></li><li class=\"cr\" data-mrow=\"schizoid-pd\" data-mrow-v=\"16291e7ff849\"><div class=\"wh\"><b class=\"nm mask\">Schizoid personality disorder</b><span class=\"win\">Lifelong, from adolescence or early adulthood</span></div><div class=\"wb\"><div class=\"rail cstrip\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:0%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:20%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:38%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:62%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:84%\"></i><i class=\"cs trait\" style=\"--a:24%;--b:100%\"></i></div><div class=\"rax\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"a0\" style=\"--x:0%\">Child</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:20%\">Teens</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:38%\">20s</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:62%\">30s</span><span class=\"a1\" style=\"--x:84%\">40s+</span></div><p class=\"wl\">Prefers to be alone; detached, little emotion</p><p class=\"wl\">No odd beliefs or eccentric behavior</p><p class=\"wl dec\">No hallucinations or delusions</p></div></li><li class=\"cr\" data-mrow=\"paranoid-pd\" data-mrow-v=\"b6d1b76ca050\"><div class=\"wh\"><b class=\"nm mask\">Paranoid personality disorder</b><span class=\"win\">Lifelong, from adolescence or early adulthood</span></div><div class=\"wb\"><div class=\"rail cstrip\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:0%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:20%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:38%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:62%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:84%\"></i><i class=\"cs trait\" style=\"--a:24%;--b:100%\"></i></div><div class=\"rax\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"a0\" style=\"--x:0%\">Child</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:20%\">Teens</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:38%\">20s</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:62%\">30s</span><span class=\"a1\" style=\"--x:84%\">40s+</span></div><p class=\"wl\">Suspicious, distrustful, hypervigilant</p><p class=\"wl\">No odd beliefs, magical thinking or eccentric speech</p><p class=\"wl dec\">No period of persistent delusions or hallucinations</p></div></li></ol><div class=\"lc-key\"><span><i class=\"cs pro\"></i>Prodrome</span><span><i class=\"cs act\"></i>Active psychosis</span><span><i class=\"cs res\"></i>Residual</span><span><i class=\"cs only\"></i>A delusion only</span><span><i class=\"cs hi\"></i>Manic episode</span><span><i class=\"cs hip\"></i>Manic episode with psychosis</span><span><i class=\"cs trait\"></i>Lifelong trait, no psychosis</span><span><i class=\"cs odd\"></i>Lifelong odd beliefs, no psychosis</span></div></figure>\n"
